# 触摸点击、6px 手势阈值、滚动防误触、滑块横向竞争与双指针忽略
0 expect scroll 0
0 expect sound on

# 小于 6px 移动的点击触发 Row 1 提示音切换
10 down 1 100 106
15 move 1 103 108
20 up 1 103 108
20 expect sound off
20 expect ring false
20 expect capture none

# 垂直拖动超过 6px 锁定 ScrollY，不触发途经控件点击
30 down 1 100 106
35 expect capture candidate
40 move 1 100 66
40 expect capture scrolling
40 expect scroll 40
50 up 1 100 66
50 expect capture none
50 expect sound off

# 滑回顶部后横向拖动亮度滑块
60 down 1 100 66
70 move 1 100 106
80 up 1 100 106
80 expect scroll 0

90 down 1 254 62
100 move 1 290 62
100 expect capture slider
100 expect scroll 0
110 up 1 290 62
110 expect capture none
110 expect brightness 95

# 第二指针在第一指针未抬起时被忽略
